        "created_at": "2018-12-18T12:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They don't?</p>\n<p>They have the same HP as the non-foil versions.</p>\n<p>...</p>\n<p>Unless your mistaking the Void Guard versions (which are for different decks) for the Sentinels team.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The 24 HP Medico is for the Void Guard Medico deck, not The Sentinels deck. (See <a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-void-guard.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a> for the product)</p>",
